# Peter's vegetable-box example (2026-09-13), as a `loop` session. Where an
# offer holds is a bare place in its conjunction; place and time match when
# one contains the other; and a want may be met by several gives at once —
# the grocer's box at the shop plus the courier's run to the door is one
# composed leg of a circulation the solver finds and clearing re-derives.
#
#   LOOP_HOME=$(mktemp -d) ONTODAG_HOME=$(mktemp -d) loop --catalogue examples/delivery.od < examples/delivery.loop
set confirm off
set now 2026-09-13T09:00:00Z
place shop 41.3874,2.1686,20m
place door 41.4036,2.1744,20m
set maker grocer
give vegetable-box shop 5
want bicycle-repair shop 6
set maker buyer
want vegetable-box door 8
matches
give piano-lesson door 4
give piano-lesson door 4
set maker courier
give transport from(sp3) to(sp3) 2
want piano-lesson geo(sp3) 5
set maker mechanic
give bicycle-repair geo(sp3) 5
want piano-lesson geo(sp3) 5
loops
clearing
